;;; EXERCISE

#|
Write a short sketch for flute, violoncello and piano by
extending one or more of your last homeworks.

Each part should be assembled from different material 

You may control the pitch range with "ambitus-instrument".

See under "Score-Layout" how to layout the score,
(:layout is a key variable for "def-score").
|#

